<title>USA: Competitive sales total $25 mln for Aug 29.</title>
<headline>Competitive sales total $25 mln for Aug 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive bond sales total $25 million in four offerings for Thursday, August 29, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $13.7 million South Orange &amp; Mapelwood, N.J., Board of Education offering at 1100 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
